{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"印度尼西亚","country_iso":"IDN","created_at":"2026-03-23T10:17:22.817502","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"IDN-XX-0006","ldc":"No","location":"三宝垄","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"印尼三宝垄二期项目","project_name_en":"Indonesia Semarang Phase II Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"中建四局国际","content":"印尼市场在二季度捷报频传。中建四局印尼分公司、安装分公司齐头并进，接连中标英发滨淡南山工业园1GW高效电池EPC总承包工程等项目，合同额提前完成全年指标，营业收入实现时间过半、任务过半\n1\n项目位于印尼滨淡岛，展现了印尼分公司深耕印尼、走向外岛的坚强决心，项目建成后将助力分公司巩固光伏厂房业务的既有优势、塑强新能源产品线。\n2\n项目位于印尼三宝垄，印尼国别以现场出市场，顺利承接业主安装工程，标志着安装公司迈出工业安装领域的第一步。\n3\n项目位于印尼三宝垄，是东菱科技集团布局印尼小家电市场战略的重要一环，印尼分公司以优质履约赢得业主信赖，承接该后续工程。项目建成后将进一步巩固四局在印尼三宝垄肯达尔工业园区的优势地位。\n4\n项目位于印尼三宝垄，通过一期项目的优质履约，顺利承接业主二期项目。项目建成后，将助力业主优化在海外的发展布局，推动四局在海外新能源赛道加速跑。\n5\n项目位于印尼卡拉旺，是印尼分公司与国内重大战略客户的二次牵手合作，为三一集团在印尼市场发展添薪续力，开启双方合作共赢的新篇章。\n6\n项目位于印尼勿加泗，是印尼分公司与属地大业主的二次合作，对于推动属地化发展具有重要意义。","content_sha256":"09b5ef59f365a0b6c165e2ec9701cb0e8eb0102938c2d3d4a95bbbbcc1093e32","id":7793,"publish_date":"2024-07-04 14:50:03","title":"中建四局印尼分公司、安装分公司接连中标英发滨淡南山工业园  高效电池EPC总承包工程等项目","title_sha256":"75572846dde5bfe14fce036eb83e1c285ca0077fdf01436797efd5c3be1aac89","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/67954.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"IDN-XX-0006","capacity_details":"","capacity_mw":null,"capacity_mw_raw":"","capacity_source":null,"contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T10:17:22.817785","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"IDN-XX-0006-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[\"https://www.ceec.net.cn/art/2025/4/8/art_11019_2534910.html\"]","official_website_links":"[]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"","project_developer_en":null,"project_stage":"签约","project_summary":"中建四局印尼分公司承接了印尼三宝垄的二期项目，该项目是基于一期项目的优质履约。项目建成后将助力业主优化海外发展布局，并推动中建四局在新能源领域发展。","publish_date":"2024-07-04 14:50:03","pv_capacity_mw":null,"source_links":"[\"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/67954.html\"]","storage_energy_mwh":null,"storage_power_mw":null,"total_investment_usd":null,"total_investment_usd_raw":"","transmission_capacity_mw":null,"verification_confidence":null,"verification_sources":null,"verification_status":"unverified","voltage_kv":null}}],"evidence_policy":{"exact_quote_required":true,"quote_must_not_cross_surfaces":true,"valid_surfaces":["title","body"]},"project_id":"IDN-XX-0006","schema_version":"storage-taxonomy-evidence-package-v1","selection_reasons":["active_hybrid_category"]}
